## Resumo

```
Frontend : React 18 + React Router 6 + Vite 5 + TS 5.6 + Tailwind 3 + axios + lucide-react
Backend  : FastAPI 0.115 + Pydantic v2 + SQLAlchemy 2.0 + psycopg2
Auth     : FastAPI (serviço separado, porta 8001)
DB       : PostgreSQL 17 (Docker Compose)
```
